  "statuteText": "40:14-b Default Budget Determined by Budget Committee. –\n\nIn a local political subdivision that has adopted the official ballot referenda form of meeting pursuant to RSA 40:14 and has also adopted a municipal budget committee pursuant to RSA 32:14, the determination of the default budget shall be by the budget committee instead of the governing body."
